{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/c37fbcd987fdef6e69ee9381087e2c31.avif?t=1772672760\" width=384 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a comprehensive evaluation process lasting <strong>0.8 seconds</strong>, <strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">[InsertCompanyName]</span></strong> is pleased to offer you a position as an <strong>Arbitrator</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A role of <strong>high responsibility</strong>, <strong>high mobility</strong>, and <strong>highly flexible life expectancy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/1d17d182e72bc734e2895445b20f3fa9.poster.avif?t=1772672760\" width=720 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/1d17d182e72bc734e2895445b20f3fa9.webm?t=1772672760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/1d17d182e72bc734e2895445b20f3fa9.mp4?t=1772672760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR MISSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At <strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">[InsertCompanyName]</span></strong>, we believe productivity is a fragile ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, prolonged exposure to <strong>targets, deadlines, and particular office culture</strong> may cause certain employees to experience\u2026 <strong>irregular behavioral transformations</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some may describe it as <i><strong>BURNOUT</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others prefer the term <i><strong>TILTED</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an Arbitrator, your role is simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore order.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move quickly, react faster and neutralize threats before they impact workplace efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corridor, meeting room, and open-space battlefield will test your reflexes in <strong>fast, brutal, precision-driven combat</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/9b55cdbaadb6e5ec9aded1a716dadd03.poster.avif?t=1772672760\" width=720 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/9b55cdbaadb6e5ec9aded1a716dadd03.webm?t=1772672760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/9b55cdbaadb6e5ec9aded1a716dadd03.mp4?t=1772672760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A DYNAMIC WORK ENVIRONMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">[InsertCompanyName]</span></strong> is proud to offer a <strong>diverse professional setting</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your assignments will take you across a wide range of corporate departments, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sterile <strong>administrative sectors</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collapsing <strong>open-space offices</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >experimental <strong>wellness facilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >restricted <strong>executive floors</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and several areas that officially <strong>do not exist</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor presents new layouts, new hazards, and new forms <span class=\"bb_strike\">of <strong>organizational dysfunction</strong>.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptability is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/6f0137a4bbfe791d8702935bd9f3eb4d.poster.avif?t=1772672760\" width=720 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/6f0137a4bbfe791d8702935bd9f3eb4d.webm?t=1772672760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/6f0137a4bbfe791d8702935bd9f3eb4d.mp4?t=1772672760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET YOUR COLLEAGUES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At <strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">[InsertCompanyName]</span></strong>, people are <span class=\"bb_strike\">our <strong>greatest</strong></span><strong> asset</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your career as an Arbitrator, you will meet many <span class=\"bb_strike\">wonderful</span> coworkers who embody the company\u2019s core values: <strong>dedication, resilience, and quiet acceptance</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our employees are known for their positive mindset, their strong work ethic, and their remarkable ability to keep going no matter the circumstances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some may appear tired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some may appear concerned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some may have spent an unusual amount of time in the building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But rest assured: everyone here is doing <strong>perfectly fine</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the time to talk with your colleagues during your assignments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They may offer helpful advice, share motivational insights, <span class=\"bb_strike\">or briefly mention things that definitely <strong>did not happen on the 12th floor</strong>.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/2e2962556221ac2a0dd558ffcbdc2e12.poster.avif?t=1772672760\" width=720 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/2e2962556221ac2a0dd558ffcbdc2e12.webm?t=1772672760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/2e2962556221ac2a0dd558ffcbdc2e12.mp4?t=1772672760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO NEED TO DIG DEEPER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For <strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">[InsertCompanyName]</span></strong>, transparency is <span class=\"bb_strike\">an important</span> value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which is why we encourage employees <strong>not to concern themselves with matters outside their assigned responsibilities</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your assignments, you may occasionally notice things such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >confidential documents left where they should not be</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >restricted areas that appear to still be in use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >internal programs that are not listed in any official system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >archived records referencing departments that have never existed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These occurrences are <strong>administrative artifacts</strong> and do not require investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attempting to understand them may lead to <strong>unnecessary confusion</strong>, <strong>reduced productivity</strong>, and <strong>questions that fall outside your clearance level</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For your comfort and professional wellbeing, we recommend focusing on your duties <span class=\"bb_strike\">and <strong>ignoring anything that appears unusual</strong>.</span>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/d236dad5e043cf9ab83b4039ae80f549.poster.avif?t=1772672760\" width=720 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/d236dad5e043cf9ab83b4039ae80f549.webm?t=1772672760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/d236dad5e043cf9ab83b4039ae80f549.mp4?t=1772672760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXCELLENT EMPLOYEE BENEFITS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an Arbitrator, you will enjoy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >access to <strong>a wide variety of order-maintenance tools</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >temporary <strong>performance-enhancing corporate beverages</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >recognition through <strong>prestigious internal symbols of achievement</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the opportunity to contribute directly to <strong>organizational stability</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Order is Productivity. Productivity is Peace. Peace is Optional.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">[InsertCompanyName]</span>\u2122</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be part of <strong>Something Greater</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apply / Wishlist</strong> Now.   <br>   <br>Made By Maxence Jacquot    <br>Music By Julien Ramirez </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2684550?t=1772672760","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/28ba34568921f6a02390690eea65fceb42264140/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772672760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/2ae2d422d330d87042f816112ca9d46114c9a012/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772672760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/2ae2d422d330d87042f816112ca9d46114c9a012/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772672760","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3878530,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684550/extras/c37fbcd987fdef6e69ee9381087e2c31.avif?t=1772672760\" width=384 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a comprehensive evaluation process lasting <strong>0.8 seconds</strong>, <strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">[InsertCompanyName]</span></strong> is pleased to offer you a position as an <strong>Arbitrator</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A role of <strong>high responsibility</strong>, <strong>high mobility</strong>, and <strong>highly flexible life expectancy</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"